description:
Provision of a countywide Real Time Passenger Information (RTPI) solution, including:
RTPI software for existing and future RTPI assets;
Maintenance, repair and lifecycle management of the RTPI estate;
Supply, installation and commissioning of new and replacement RTPI equipment; and
Ongoing support, monitoring and reporting services.
The contract supports the provision and development of real-time passenger information across Essex to improve accessibility to public transport information and enc
